WEBVTT

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:03.600
to a new city so far away, 
without a convenient way to travel.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.969
It was about sending their daughter away,

00:02:06.969 --> 00:02:11.340
but my parents showed 
immense faith in their daughter,

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:13.480
and courageously sent me off.

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.690
(Applause)

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:22.270
This was the beginning 
of my journey to explore space.

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:24.790
I have been associated with ISRO
in many big missions,

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.320
being operations director
for many of them,

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:30.500
but the Mars mission
was the biggest one for me.